1399+ 6CCF CB 3F            srl  a
1400+ 6CD1 CB 3F            srl  a
1401+ 6CD3 CB 3F            srl  a
1402+ 6CD5 CB 3F            srl  a                  ; Sposta i 4 bit superiori in quelli inferiori (GGGG)
1403+ 6CD7 32 B8 78         ld   (room_gravity_preset), a
